5,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,We need to establish a clear purpose for the break room. I suggest we look at the actual usage patterns before deciding.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. It would be wise to understand how the space currently functions and how it affects our interactions.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,Let's make sure we don't pick something that just creates more chores for one person. I want to see the real effort involved.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,A rational approach is best. I'm interested in the financial implications of our current habits and the costs of changing them.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,It is a pleasure to discuss this with you all. I believe we should consider the physical environment and the peace of those nearby.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"I'll start by checking the ""Fortnight's tally of use by person"" and the ""Final clear-out of the old fridge"" to see who is actually using the space.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I will look into ""Unplanned talk since the refit"" and ""Where the last awkward conversation happened"" to gauge our social needs.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,"I'm going for ""Round trip for a hot lunch"" and ""Crumbs and bins at the desks"" to see how much time and mess we're dealing with.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"I'll examine the ""Invoices for outside hire by the hour"" and ""Quotes for the two fit-outs"" to see the numbers.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"I shall investigate ""The partition wall to the office"" and ""Facilities callouts on this floor"" to understand the impact on our workspace.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
